Error [jet.FixedTimingWideHolder]: `Int` holds a `Key` value
  --> tests/ui/taint/fixed_timing_value_in_int_or_float_is_e0738.jet:3:30
    |
  3 | widen: fn(k: #Key U64, wide: #Key Int) -> U64 {
    |                              ^^^^^^^^
 Why: `Key` is `timing: .Fixed`, and an `Int` (a big integer) or a `Float` takes time that depends on its value
 Fix: Keep the value in a fixed-width type such as `U64` or `[U8]`, or reveal it through a `#Scrub(Key)` function first
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0738

